WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.460
Have you ever wished you could take

2
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:05.680
back something you said?

3
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.960
Maybe God has forgiven you,

4
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.960
but someone else is still hurting.

5
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.960
Romans twelve tells us to love sincerely

6
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.320
and seek peace,

7
00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.380
as far as it depends on us.

8
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.740
You can start by telling the truth.

9
00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:19.520
Say,

10
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.480
“I was wrong to speak to you

11
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.160
that way.” Then listen.

12
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.040
Change the way you speak.

13
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:27.540
You cannot make someone trust you.

14
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.960
Give them time and respect the space

15
00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:30.560
they need.

16
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.820
Jesus gave himself for you.

17
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.540
You can face what you did

18
00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:36.320
and take a step toward peace,

19
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.000
resting in his love.
